<title>USA: Eastern American Natural sets distribution.</title>
<headline>Eastern American Natural sets distribution.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, W.Va. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern American Natural Gas Trust declared a distribution of $0.4152 per unit.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on or before June 16 to unitholders of record on May 30.</p>
<p>The prior distribution was $0.46136 per unit.</p>
<p>The company said the amount of each distribuiton is variable based on the spot price of natural gas and production volumes.</p>
</text>
